== Ported source carried in the package: the WebP decoder ==

The WebP decoder of Pdfwright (src/Pdfwright/Images/Webp*.cs, Vp8*.cs, Vp8l*.cs) is a C# port of the WebP decoder of golang.org/x/image, tag v0.48.0, with the YUV to RGB conversion of libwebp, tag v1.6.0, added.
Each ported file says so in its header and carries the notice of its source. See docs/decisions/0001-webp-decoder.md. The licences and the patent grants of both projects follow, as their licences require.
The name of Google is not used to endorse Pdfwright or anything derived from it.

